# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

# ASP.NET Core secrets and environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets.json

